# Working draft under industry standards

Status may say Draft/Proposed (**content** maturity). Standards **form** is required.

| Practice | Binding |
| --- | --- |
| ISO/IEC/IEEE 29148-shaped requirements engineering | Stakeholder / Software Requirements shape; implementation-free requirement text |
| Architecture Tradeoff Analysis Method | Six-part Quality Attribute Scenario before Design influence |
| Nygard Architecture Decision Record | Context / Decision / Status / Consequences |
| Decision Framework | Six vectors + usage + locus + rejected alternatives; research-depth gate before Accept |
| Whole words | `GLOSSARY.md` |

Do not soft-pass Definition of Ready with schema file counts.
